336", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974827_126191969379669_7612736244549055214_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-o6dDsZhDTEQ7kNvwHw46_p&_nc_oc=AdpoQoiuX2nTuo7pjQkvGkKYR5yVryGbu6n2QdHNqOAkRdCTL_YU5XLPX062knFL5dU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPVXb4ENiOuIyue7ldCIHDs3LIwDHTSm6DndIkGKA30ow&oe=6ACE5488"}, {"file_name": "Capture 8aa.png", "id": "237969191155872", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974827_237969194489205_3331846548083113255_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5JCV_qvEGakQ7kNvwHi-VE3&_nc_oc=AdrY9BgsjFgGJW03o6pROVsbYarJA1P-txmLLP6XoLuu2_xYMWELD-8OI05jW_qy-44&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMMfJbu3N6OlAWKiaW2FttVoajL83sNzFOzUnxfpTSeog&oe=6ACE37E8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "ROVR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Take your quarterback play to the next level with professional grade VR training.  Learn, move, interact, and make-decisions just like you do on the field. \n\nThe REPS ROVR App lets you learn and improve sport specific time sensitive decision-making while getting unlimited repetitions through immersive virtual reality using the patent-pending REPS development system.  Each practice repetition is graded and recorded for review by the player or a coach.  The untethered Quest headset and ROVR\u2019s handsfree vision and voice interface allows you to move with a ball in your hand just as you would in your sport.  Practice on your own or with a remote coach to take your play to the next level.    \n", "short_description": "Take your quarterback play to the next level with professional grade VR training.  Learn, move, interact, and make-decisions just like you do on the field. The REPS ROVR App lets you learn and improve sport specific time sensitive decision-making while getting unlimited repetitions through immersive virtual reality using the pa